# Duty on the M1 body: 30 ms strikes every 60 ms ask for 50% of a 30% budget.
# The bucket holds 1000 ms x 30% = 30000, a full strike adds 3000, 60 ms drains 1800.
# 23 strikes fill it, then only some get through. Soft 12 ms strikes never run out.
